{"4462560": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Incog-Confine", "steam_appid": 4462560, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4855740], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;Our hope to dilute deaths rain resides in the cavity you feed&quot;</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survivors...you've homed incog's decaying belly, manifested its circulatory system, left with damned faith in our perilous construction but this being must be nurtured. Do not let the storm tear through Incog's skin and do not perish in your endeavors.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >IPSR: incog's notion</h2></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Identify your space: Everything you perceive may not be what it seems. The socket bulb contains limited recourse. Spare your light; adapt your ears.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your objective: One misstep can lead to sacrifice or extinction. Your Cardiac Monitor possesses satnav properties, utilize this system to strategize the volatile lands. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge the lands: Any whole or broken matter can provide. The pack is designed to expand while the fuel tank is designed to counterweight, manage your trips.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repair what's broken: If it can be fixed, take initiative. Your synthetic peripheral displays blueprint components, combine scrap for tools to come. </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;Reflect our faith and it will be mirrored&quot;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >INCOG-CONFINE is a co-op driven, psychological horror set upon post-apocalyptic lands of an unknown world.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;Our hope to dilute deaths rain resides in the cavity you feed&quot;</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragr